#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/email.md:4
msgid ""
"Habitat-backed IMAP/SMTP mail client (`/email`). Entity model: [`docs/"
"product/entity-model.md`](../product/entity-model.md) (Email module)."
msgstr ""

#. type: Content of: <messages><msg>
#: docs/modules/email.md:5 messages/po4a/en.xml:486
#, no-wrap
msgid "Capabilities"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/email.md:14
msgid ""
"Multi-mailbox sync (INBOX / Sent / Drafts / Trash + custom); LIST + SPECIAL-"
"USE"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/email.md:14
msgid "Flags: `\\Seen` / `\\Flagged` write-back and FLAGS refresh on sync"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/email.md:14
msgid "Send: SMTP + APPEND Sent; drafts in Drafts mailbox"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/email.md:14
msgid "Delete: move to Trash (default); mailbox CREATE/RENAME/DELETE"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/email.md:14
msgid ""
"IDLE on inbox + cron `builtin-email-sync-all` every 5m across **all worlds** "
"(enabled accounts); auto-sync new inbox subjects → one user notification; "
"manual `email.sync` does not notify"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/email.md:14
msgid "Local hybrid search (synced messages only)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#: docs/modules/email.md:14
msgid "List multi-select: mark read/unread, star, move, delete (serial RPC)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Title ##
#: docs/modules/email.md:15
#, no-wrap
msgid "Habitat RPC (selected)"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/email.md:18
msgid ""
"`email.mailbox.list|create|rename|delete`, `email.message.list|read|markRead|"
"markUnread|markFlagged|markUnflagged|move|delete|search`, `email.send`, "
"`email.draft.save|send`, `email.sync`, `emailaccount.*`."
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#: docs/modules/email.md:21
msgid ""
"ToolSets `email-account` and `email` (`email_sync`, `email_list`, "
"`email_search`, `email_mark_read`, `email_mark_flagged`, `email_move`, …)."
msgstr ""
